{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15110100","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15110100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1511010001:0":{"text":"정신의 큐브는 의지를 시험하는 건가요?","source_cn":"精神之楔会考验意志吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F97F0271648991D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1511010002:0":{"text":"제 생각에 봉인의 큐브는 누군가를 시험하기 위해 설치한 게 아닌 것 같아요. 하지만 일종의 시험이라고 이해하셔도 돼요.","source_cn":"我想，封印之楔的设置绝不是为了考验谁。但你的确可以将它...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECD41CFC260C3AC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1511010003:0":{"text":"시험에 통과한 사람은 분명 신의 힘 앞에서도 흔들리지 않는 결의를 가지고 있는 사람일 테니까요.","source_cn":"通过考验之人，一定拥有面对神力也不会动摇的决意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC190676C411D817F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:加拉":{"text":"갈라","source":"加拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:初代梅林":{"text":"초대 멀린","source":"初代梅林","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":2}}